Scope

This licence covers the original work in this repository: the FrostByte shell
(frostbyte/), LeopardEGL (leopardegl/), the build system (build.sh, scripts/,
config/, toolchain/ apart from the patches named below, deps/build-deps.sh),
and the tools and documentation written for this project.

It does not cover third-party software or changes made to it. Those keep their
own licences:
  - patches/ (changes to WebKit / WPE WebKit): GNU LGPL 2.1 and BSD licences,
    as marked in each WebKit source file they change.
  - deps/patches/ (changes to GLib, glib-networking, GStreamer, FFmpeg, dav1d,
    libepoxy, libgcrypt, libgpg-error, orc): the licence of the package each
    patch applies to.
  - toolchain/darwin-cross/patches/gcc/: GNU GPL 3 or later (GCC).
  - toolchain/darwin-cross/patches/cctools/: Apple Public Source License 2.0
    (cctools, ld64).
  - Camino toolbar and tab artwork (frostbyte/resources/toolbar/,
    frostbyte/resources/tabs/): Mozilla Public License 2.0, see the
    LICENSE-images.txt files beside them.

NOTICE lists every third-party component that ends up inside FrostByte.app and
its licence.
